WEBVTT

00:32:57.231 --> 00:33:00.552
My experience with suffering
is that true suffering --

00:33:00.576 --> 00:33:02.377
you can't have any perspective on it.

00:33:02.401 --> 00:33:04.553
I have perspective on it now,

00:33:04.577 --> 00:33:07.490
but I didn't have any perspective
on it when it was happening.

00:33:07.514 --> 00:33:09.601
True suffering is literally unbearable.

00:33:09.625 --> 00:33:11.202
That's how you know you're in it.

00:33:11.226 --> 00:33:14.476
You can't bear it. It's awful.

00:33:14.500 --> 00:33:17.260
But you don't have to move in,

00:33:17.284 --> 00:33:21.559
because resilience is also
one of the things that we possess,

00:33:21.583 --> 00:33:24.038
and healing is one
of the things that we possess.

00:33:24.062 --> 00:33:27.861
And perspective over time becomes
one of the things that we possess,

00:33:27.885 --> 00:33:31.107
where we're able to look back
on our dark nights of the soul